You need to know, whatever practical, what kind of compression you are using, you need to be aware of the environment it was designed for.

35:17.140 --> 35:22.920
And most importantly, for the things that truly matter in your profession or your life, you need to maintain your expansion capacity.

35:23.040 --> 35:23.280
Got it.

