If our entire global civilization is increasingly offloading the messy, expensive, painful search phase of learning onto autonomous systems and AI, and we as a species only ever interact with their neatly compressed, perfectly fluent answers,

36:27.120 --> 36:30.720
Are we collectively risking a species-wide expansion deficit?

